  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9bc4902ccea98cf44865aecb61fc1ff4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Luka
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Luka
  LastName: Tsereteli
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Schoolchild
  CharacterDescription: Ten years old, nervous, avoids eye contact
  CharacterArc: Small and perpetually anxious, Luka filled out the checkpoint form twice
    because he wasn't sure the first one counted. He lives on the fourth floor of Block
    C with his mother. His father is in Varka for work and hasn't called in a week.
    School closed without warning and no one explained when or if it would reopen. He
    isn't old enough to understand everything that is happening, but he is old enough
    to know that the adults around him are scared, and that they are trying very hard
    not to show it.
  DateOfBirth: 11/04/1982
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 30 OCT
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
  handwritingFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8e89ead54f8523428cc2e34f005bb5e, type: 2}
  startingInfectionScore: 0
  dailyInfectionProgression: {x: 3, y: 8}
  alterEgoName: 
  basePersonalityDescriptors: []
  normalBehaviorNotes: 
  IDPhoto: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 041366a5b1a1d2b4cba16bd7f40c9cb5, type: 3}
  CharacterPrefab: {fileID: 1056441159091504059, guid: 54121aa9f487ffc41af9a7c2863302bc, type: 3}
  entryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Coming back from the corner shop. My mum needed bread.
    - I was playing outside with Dima. He went home so I came back.
    - I went to check if the school gates were open yet.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Coming inside because of the ash outside.
    - My mum sent me to get something from our neighbor in Block A.
    - Seeking shelter from the radioactive dust.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Seeking refuge from the falling ash.
    - Returning to the only place I still know.
    - Just coming home. I don't have anywhere else to go.
  invalidEntryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Going to school. It's still open. I'm sure it's still open.
    - Going to meet Dima, even though his family left last week.
    - Going to see my teacher. She still lives on Ulitsa Komsomolskaya.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Going to school. The gates are locked but maybe they're open today.
    - Going to find my friend Petya from class. He said he'd wait for me.
    - My mum's at work. She'll be back soon. She's definitely still at work.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Going to school. I think it might be open today. It might be.
    - I left my jacket at Dima's flat. I'm going to get it back.
    - To see if the vending machine in Block C is still working.
  entryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Sorry, I have the form somewhere \u2014 I swear I had it."
    - It is a lot quieter outside than it used to be.
    - I keep telling myself it's going to be fine. Is it going to be fine?
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - I didn't sleep much. I don't think anyone did.
    - My hands keep shaking and I can't tell if it's the cold or something else.
    - I emailed my parents again. The server just keeps timing out.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - I stopped checking the news. It wasn't helping.
    - Do you think it matters anymore? Coming through here, I mean.
    - I just want to go somewhere quiet and sit for a while.
