  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Thank you. Sorry for the wait.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Okay. Thanks. Try to stay safe out here.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Right. Okay. I'll... yeah. Thank you.
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "What? No \u2014 I didn't do anything wrong!"
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Please, I just want to go back to the dorm.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - I knew something like this was going to happen. I always knew.
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Wait \u2014 I don't want \u2014 I wasn't ready \u2014"
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Please... I still had things... I still had things to do...
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - I knew... I always knew... it was going to end like this...
  quarantineExitLines:
  - "I \u2014 okay. Okay. It\u2019s okay. I just need a minute. Give me a minute."
  - "I\u2019m not infected. I\u2019ve been so careful. I\u2019ve been so incredibly
    careful."
  - "Please don\u2019t tell my parents. They\u2019ll just worry more. Please."
  killExitLines:
  - "But I hadn\u2019t \u2014 I was supposed to \u2014 I still had things \u2014
    I still had things \u2014"
  - "I wasn\u2019t ready\u2026 I wasn\u2019t even close to ready\u2026"
  - "I want my mom\u2026 I just\u2026 I want my mom\u2026"
  voiceAudioClips: []
  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0cd0b2982be60c644a30780b118c3dc1, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Outside. I went to check if the school gates were open.
    midDaysAnswer: The courtyard. There was ash everywhere so I came back inside.
    finalDaysAnswer: Just walking. I didn't want to stay inside anymore.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Home. I haven't been outside at all. I've been upstairs
      the whole time.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: School. It's still open. I was there this morning. I'm
      sure I was.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: School. Everything is fine. It is definitely still open.
      I go every day.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Have you been experiencing any strange symptoms lately?
    earlyDaysAnswer: I've been anxious. More than usual. But everyone is.
    midDaysAnswer: I've had nosebleeds three times this week. I looked it up online
      but the connection keeps dropping.
    finalDaysAnswer: I try not to think about it. Thinking about it makes it worse.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: I'm calm. I feel steady. Clear-headed. I don't know
      what everyone else is so worried about.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: No nosebleeds. Nothing at all. I've been completely fine.
      I haven't been researching symptoms. I haven't.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I'm honestly good. Slept well. Ate. Everything is fine.
      It's all going to be okay. I think.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Who do you live with?
    earlyDaysAnswer: My mum. And my dad, but he's away for work in Varka right now.
    midDaysAnswer: Just my mum. My dad hasn't called in a week.
    finalDaysAnswer: Just me right now. My mum went to find food. She said she'd
      be back.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Mum and dad and my sister. We're all home. Everything
      is normal. Everything is fine.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Mum and dad. Dad came back from Varka. Everything is fine.
      He came back.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Mum and dad and my friend Dima is staying over. Everyone
      is there. Everyone is fine.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - "Sorry \u2014 is this the right form? I filled it out twice just in case."
    - It is a lot quieter outside lately. Did you notice that from here?
    - My hands keep shaking. It is probably just the cold.
    midDays:
    - Have you heard anything about Varka? My dad is there for work.
    - I am not sleeping well. I think it shows. Sorry.
    - "Is the process taking longer than usual today? I do not mind, I am just \u2014
      checking."
    finalDays:
    - Do you think it still matters? Coming through here. I keep doing it anyway.
    - I stopped checking the news. It was not helping.
    - "Is there somewhere safer than this? Just \u2014 anywhere. I am asking everyone."
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
